    <div class="tg-white-space-preserve white-space-preserve tg-msg">#Windows
把 Win11 的右键菜单恢复成老版，重启explorer.exe生效
<code>reg.exe add "HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32" /f /ve
</code>回滚命令: <code>reg.exe delete "HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}" /f

